WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
People operations should feel clear, connected, and human. Meet AuraHR.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A role-aware dashboard surfaces the signals that matter.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Every employee has one governed, searchable story.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Onboarding connects owners, documents, readiness, probation and day-one progress.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Attendance, leave, approvals and exceptions follow familiar workflows.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Documents become trusted evidence with ownership and controlled access.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Manu helps people understand, find, draft and act—inside trusted HR controls.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Leave and attendance stay clear for employees, managers and HR.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Performance conversations keep goals, evidence and ownership connected.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Even exit journeys preserve context, accountability and organizational memory.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Operational clarity for HR. Confidence for leaders. A human experience for everyone.
